item.text:
`defaultLinkHandler` produces reStructuredText hyperlink markup: `` `name <ref.rst>`_ ``, using `name` as the link text and appending `.rst` to `ref`.

Evidence: `doc/rest_docs.go`, lines 52–54:
```go
func defaultLinkHandler(name, ref string) string {
	return fmt.Sprintf("`%s <%s.rst>`_", name, ref)
}
```
